== Undocumented Changes ==
* The ornament that adorns the {{r|Planetarium}} door was moved one pixel to the left and therefore centered.
* Holding "R" to reset a run will gradually fade the screen to black before resetting the run. If R is let go during the fadeout time, it stops the fade and the run is not reset. Overall, this makes each reset take roughly 0.2 seconds longer.
* When playing as{{c|Tainted Lazarus}}, the Active Item of both of his forms now charge upon room completion. Previously, items would only charge upon room completion for Tainted Lazarus's currently active form, effectively making any active item have double its charge time.
* Donation machines now give increased money when bombed, to compensate for them only being able to be destroyed once per run. This is especially useful on early floors, as it makes it much easier to purchase a 15 cent item.
* Picking up {{i|Dead Cat}} as Esau no longer grants {{c|Jacob and Esau}} unlimited extra lives.
* {{c|Tainted Samson}} has a new mechanic such that if he uses {{i|Suplex!}} on an enemy at the end of his berserk state, it will deal extra amounts of damage and cause a {{i|Mama Mega!}} effect. (This uses two new animations called "SuperLeapUp" and "SuperLeapDown".)
** The reason for this was due to a bug where if Tainted Samson's berserk ended while he was Suplexing, the said enemy would simply disappear, causing a softlock against some bosses
