* {{i|Sausage}} now gives a +6.9% Devil/Angel Room chance and a +6.9% Planetarium chance.
* {{i|Paschal Candle}} now increments correctly after clearing a room with {{c|Tainted Lazarus}} (before, the Flip effect took priority and Paschal Candle never had an opportunity to increment).
* Some items and trinkets with the [[Item Tags lazarussharedglobal|<code>lazarussharedglobal</code> item tag]] are now shared between both forms of {{c|Tainted Lazarus}}. This includes items that map parts of the floor such as the [[The Compass|Compass]], items that increase devil/angel deal chance such as [[Black Candle]], and items/trinkets that spawn new or altered rooms on each floor such as [[Voodoo Head]]. Items that grant a shared effect and a stat boost (such as [[Pentagram]], which grants a damage increase and increases devil deal chance), will not transfer the stat increases between forms.
* {{e|Necro}}s are now visible in their [[Bestiary Repentance|Bestiary]] entry.
* The changes to the price of certain items in an Angel shop ({{i|The Stairway}}) also applies to the prices of those items in Angel Rooms in general for {{c|Tainted Keeper}}.
* Fixed {{C|Tainted Isaac}}'s special inventory being temporarily invisible after quitting and reloading a run.
* Fixed {{C|Tainted Jacob}} becoming permanently unable to recover from his Lost form after quitting and reloading a run.
* The player the user is controlling in [[Debug Console#Unlisted Commands|"netstart"]] co-op now has a pink outline for increased visibility.

